{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "d75ae21741a94d91",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "事件",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 407
  },
  {
   "id": "891803f5f7adc05c",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "克洛德是否幕後主使？",
   "x": 340,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 1064
  },
  {
   "id": "15b656be28fbb5d6",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "印度洋王國廢墟",
   "x": 988,
   "y": 46,
   "width": 1992,
   "height": 716
  },
  {
   "id": "9590a700eb3a40e9",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "防禦法術",
   "x": 1012,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 622
  },
  {
   "id": "b503d9bb1f55ecce",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "沙羅是誰？",
   "x": 3004,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 873
  },
  {
   "id": "7cd06267e3772795",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**法力失控爆炸**\n\n法力失控導致的爆炸使長老團陷入混亂，未能追回沙羅",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "ae9f2da770f2c345",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**解封埃爾確**\n\n沙羅找到並解封埃爾確",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "f715b58c51a49031",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**保守派地盤無滲透**\n\n印度洋是保守派的勢力範圍，且未發現被克洛德滲透的跡象",
   "x": 364,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "2856648159321aaa",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**解封非克洛德指使**\n\n沙羅找到並解封埃爾確並非克洛德指使",
   "x": 364,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "48ccaa79c2d21a5b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**克洛德自編自導？**\n\n無法確定海都襲擊北太平洋王國是否克洛德自編自導",
   "x": 696,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "5abfcd53ee0add86",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**衛隊合法化**\n\n證明自衛力量的重要性，衛隊得以明正言順存在",
   "x": 696,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "26504d8c3be950c4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**內戰無好處**\n\n內戰對北太平洋沒有好處",
   "x": 696,
   "y": 638,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "33952db1df1f8eec",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**北太無大得益**\n\n北太平洋王國在海都事件沒有大得益",
   "x": 696,
   "y": 865,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "50d362dfe898286f",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "動機不明確",
   "x": 696,
   "y": 1104,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#64748B"
  },
  {
   "id": "6030e4d84a6ee3d9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "印度洋公主誕生",
   "x": 1368,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "defb10ad7c0cfff7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "米迦勒襲擊",
   "x": 1700,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "9690876eebeb54bc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "露芝亞高調出現",
   "x": 2032,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1f3e00c6c4d309a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**廢墟修正力**\n\n廢墟下與米迦勒身上術式相同的修正力",
   "x": 2364,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "cfb02b135aaf30d0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**米迦勒與施術者有關**\n\n米迦勒與施術者有關，V與兩者關係不明",
   "x": 2364,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "85eea47ec1ffa025",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**游騎士介入契機**\n\n為游騎士（彭達拉薩人）介入提供契機",
   "x": 1700,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "7ef2002224cfc099",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**知悉誕生時點**\n\n米迦勒與V都知道印度洋公主將於何時誕生",
   "x": 1368,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "17a750d8d85888a6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "得知目標抵達",
   "x": 2032,
   "y": 423,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "ffe1deeae7749b2e",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "海洋生物無法靠近",
   "x": 2696,
   "y": 184,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "055e0438bb8dfc1d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "空間的篩選邏輯",
   "x": 2696,
   "y": 423,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "0313228b551b1eaf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**誓約之泉仍運作**\n\n只剩下保護誓約之泉的部分仍在運作",
   "x": 1036,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "91f0bae38a311745",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "能量供給充足",
   "x": 1036,
   "y": 423,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "6cbaba9ff238f3d9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "集成了環境能量收集",
   "x": 1036,
   "y": 662,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "f46938bebf5bfda8",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**信使暗示已死**\n\n信使暗示沙羅已死過一次",
   "x": 3028,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "9c407f90aff56d2c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**沙羅記起星盡**\n\n沙羅記起自己被迪莉亞處以星盡",
   "x": 3028,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "278f6f73bace155e",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**懷疑冒牌貨**\n\n塞雷亞、達姬懷疑沙羅是冒牌貨",
   "x": 3360,
   "y": 399,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "4155e288ed17e8ff",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**死後才有新任**\n\n現任人魚公主死亡後新任公主才能誕生",
   "x": 3111,
   "y": 626,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "c70d9fc84aeda8de",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**SWI不知露芝亞行程**\n\nSWI不確定露芝亞如何前往印度洋、不知道是「沙羅」讓她去",
   "x": 3692,
   "y": 387,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "48ddfff6e701b4fc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**SWI非沙羅同伴**\n\nSWI與「沙羅」並非同伴",
   "x": 3526,
   "y": 638,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "54ce6054bfb46e44",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**沙羅是長老的傀儡**\n\n「沙羅」是長老的傀儡",
   "x": 3526,
   "y": 877,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  }
 ],
